1. Ranking functions
These assign a rank or position to each row within a partition.
ROW_NUMBER()
Assigns a unique sequential number to each row, even on ties.
sqlSELECT name, department, salary,
  ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY department ORDER BY salary DESC) AS row_num
FROM employees;
